{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36699","headline":"赠先辈令狐补阙 · 罗隐","name":"赠先辈令狐补阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中间声迹早薰然，阻避钧衡过十年。\n碧海浪高终济物，苍梧云好已归天。\n花迎彩服离莺谷，柳傍东风触马鞭。\n应念凄凉洞庭客，夜深双泪忆渔船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36699.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36699","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}